          "message": {
            "text": "Emoji presentation is deliberately downgraded from exact to partial at one named logical transition. DM-2502 exonerates ICU, HarfBuzz, Skia, and selected-glyph raster ownership, but the mixed text-miss to bare-emoji source boundary remains absent until DM-2507; recording that state as exact would hide the production defect, while changing a raster threshold would grade the wrong stage.",
